{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "¿Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "Ah. Ya estás despierto."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "¿Cómo llegaste aquí?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "Estabas justo a mi lado ahora mismo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "No, no estaba a tu lado."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "Te quedaste congelado frente al espejo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "Así que me fui."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "¿Por qué han cambiado las habitaciones?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "Reorganicé la casa,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "para hacerte sentir más en tu salsa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "Mira..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "podemos cambiarlo a como estaba antes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "A nuestro antojo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "No tenías por qué hacerlo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "Me estaba acostumbrando al diseño."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "De todas formas, creo que te sentirás más cómodo con éste diseño."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "¿A que chí?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "¿Jugamos?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "El juego funciona así:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "Esta ficha indica un tipo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "como la salud."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "Cada uno juega una carta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "y si tu carta tiene mayor,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "estadística de salud,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "que la mía,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "tú ganas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "Recoge tus cartas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "Es mi turno."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "¡Chupiguay!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "¡Me dieron una buena mano!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "¡Yo iré primero!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "¡Okii!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "¡Tu turno!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "Toma castaña pilonga."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "¡Tu turno!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "¡El que tenga la estadística de salud más alta ganará!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "¡Todo es cuestión de atacar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "¡Concéntrate solo en la defensa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "¡Ganaste pisha!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "¡Has ganado!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "Me tienes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "Eh, eh, eh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "¡Gané!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "¡Soy la ganadora!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "¡Gané!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "¡Ja, te tengo muñaño!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "Esto es un empate."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "¡Todas iguales!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "¡Eso si que es un empate!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "El mismo valor..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// El juego de cartas se interrumpe"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "¿Qué es ese sonido?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "Viene del armario."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "¿Sonido?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "¿Q-Qué sonido?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "No he oído nada."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "¿Cómo puedes crees oír algo aquí?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "Escuché golpes, como si hubiera alguien allí dentro."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "Pero..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "No hay nadie allí..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "Me gustaría abrirlo y comprobarlo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "Estoy... un poco asustado."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "¿Pero por qué...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "Otra vez igual..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "¿¡Qué te pasa!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "Es un armario..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "¡Tengo mi ropa interior guardada ahí...!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "¿Me estás ocultando algo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "¿Por qué no me crees?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "¿Qué estoy haciendo mal?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "Lo que quiero..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "Todo lo que quiero es que estés conmigo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "Me gustaría estar contigo pero... no se."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "¡¿Por qué estás tan obsesionado con ese armario?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "¡Quiero saber qué rayos fue ese golpe!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "¿Es porque"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "este mundo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "solo tiene estas cuatro habitaciones?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "¿No te basta con eso?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "¿Por qué no puedes estar conmigo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// No quedarse con Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "Ahora lo entiendo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "Siempre lo mismo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "Si quieres revisar el armario,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "adelante,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "¡y descubre qué hay ahí dentro!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "¿Pero... qué?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "Eso pasa a veces."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "La habitación se quedó congelada mientras se cargaba."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "Solo espera un segundo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "Esto es muy raro."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "¿Estamos dentro del teléfono de alguien?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "¿Tal vez uno lento con tiempos de carga largos?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "No del todo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "Pero no todo es perfecto"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "en este mundo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "Nos están cargando "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "junto con el núcleo del mundo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "¿El núcleo del mundo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "Típico, ¿no crees?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "De todos modos, podemos,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "jugar un juego de consola,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "o jugar a las cartas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "Tú eliges."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita juega a pelear"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "¿Una partida?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "Tienes que ganar"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "cuatro veces."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "Dale caña."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "No te preocupes, al principio"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "seré suave contigo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "Eres un buen chico."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "¡Será mejor que te concentres!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "¡Toma nene!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "Bien, está bien."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "Voy a ponerme seria."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "¡Wow!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "A ver si puedes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "Golpéame ahora."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "¡Mira que eres..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "simplón!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "¡Increíble! ¡Eso sí que es habilidad!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "¿Qué pasa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "Vaya, eso es aburrido."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "Bueno,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "eso es todo. ¿Crees en el destino?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "Entonces,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "¡ponte las pilas o serás un perdedor para siempre!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "¿Qué te pasa hoy?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "Fregué el suelo contigo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "No estabas centrado."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "¡Por eso gané!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "Está bien, entonces..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "¿Qué tal si jugamos algunas cartas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "Las tengo en el dormitorio."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Puerta > [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "Eh, ¿qué pasa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "¿Dónde...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "Vaya, vaya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "Perdón..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "He descargado algo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "de la red."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "Quería arreglarme."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "Un poco desde fuera"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "pero resulta que,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "había algo con el archivo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "Lo arreglaré más tarde."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "¿Es por eso que no podemos salir de casa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "Sí, así es."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita tímida"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "Oye..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "¿Qué moscardón te ha picado?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "¿Necesitas algo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Reloj de pared"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "Este reloj de aquí,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "¿qué hora muestra?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "¿La hora actual en el juego?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "¿O está sincronizado con mi teléfono?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "A ver, cómo lo digo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "No tengo ni idea."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "Pero aquí el tiempo no importa..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "Ya sea tarde o temprano,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "una chica fuerte como yo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "siempre estará a tope de energía."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "¡No me canso nunca!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "Podemos tener una eterna primavera,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "¡o una tarde que no tendrá fin!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "Suena interesante..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "pero un poco tétrico."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "El hecho de estar atascado para siempre de esa forma..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Fotos de Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "Bonitas fotos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "¿Supongo que son mas tús?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "Chipi."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "A mí también me gustan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "¿Quién las tomó?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "¿Hay otras en este mundo también?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "Puedes jurar que sí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "Te las presentaré más tarde."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "Pero todavía no."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "Por ahora, solo quiero estar a solas contigo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "¿Adónde fue el portal?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "¿O como sea que lo llamaste?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "He usado..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "algo de magia,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "para moverlo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "en algún otro lugar."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "Ya no lo necesitamos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "Simplemente sería un estorbo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Espejo en el dormitorio"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "Mirándose en un espejo sin"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "ver un reflejo... es espeluznante."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "Podemos activar los reflejos"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "si realmente quieres."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "¿Pero necesitamos eso?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "Claro que sí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "O... ¿activarlos tendrá consecuencias?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "Sí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "Nos producirían lag y nos moveríamos más lento."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "¿Alguna vez has visto dibujos animados con pocos fotogramas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "Será así para nosotros todo el tiempo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "Lo pillo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "Entonces, quizás sea mejor mantener las reflexiones apagadas..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "Una cosa, [player],"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "¿Seguro que te gustan los espejos, verdad?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "¿Tienes miedo de ver una sonrisa en tu cara?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "¿Cómo? no te sigo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "Estoy exhausto,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "después de tanto curro."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Zapatillas azules"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "¿Son tuyas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "No, son tuyas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "¿No lo recuerdas?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "No recuerdo haber tenido unas zapatillas como esas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "Lo que podrías hacer,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "sería usarlas,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "cuando salgamos al exterior."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "¿Y qué pasa con la ropa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "Todo lo que tengo en éste mundo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "es esta, la ropa que llevo puesta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "¿Hay alguna forma de conseguir trapos nuevos?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "Por supuesto que las hay."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "Aunque he visto los conjuntos que te pones."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "Y honestamente, tu gusto no es muy fino que digamos."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "Pero no te lamentes, que te ayudaré a conseguir algo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "Pero ahora no."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "Luego, luego."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "Si tú lo dices."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Juegos en la TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "¿A qué quieres jugar?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Juego leche"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "¡Este es un juego de lucha!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "¡Veamos quién sale escaldado primero!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "¡Qué juegardo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "Ya hemos tenido suficiente por ahora, hagamos otra cosa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Juego pingüinos"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "En este juego, eres un pingüino"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "deslizándose por ahí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "¿Lo captas? De eso trata el juego."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Quedarse con Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "¿Emmm, qué?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "¿Hablas en serio? Pensé que lo decías en plan coña..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "¡Estoy muy contenta,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "y un poco confundida...!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "Pero..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "Por favor, quédate conmigo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "siempre y para siempre."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// Un juego sobre pingüinos"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "Es súper simple:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "solo recoge bolas de nieve."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "¡El que mas recoge, gana!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "¡Juguemos dos rondas, ¿de acuerdo?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// El primer mapa"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "¡Anda, ¿cómo conseguiste tantas bolas?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "¡Tengo la mayor cantidad de bolas!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "¡Será mejor que nos pongamos al día!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "¡Ah, 1:1!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// El segundo mapa"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "¡Naciste para ser pingüino!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "¡Debería llevarte al glaciar de verdad!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "Pfft, que lentorro eres."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "¿Aún estás pensando en la última ronda?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "¡Vaya, un empate! ¡Eso sí que no me lo esperaba!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// El juego ha terminado"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "Bien, ¿quieres jugar a otra cosa?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "¿O ya te aburriste?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "¿Para qué necesitas eso?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "¿Eres más que un experto en videojuego?"}
